TranslationUnitDecl
|-TypeAliasTemplateDecl Ptr
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
| `-TypeAliasDecl Ptr 'T *'
|-TypeAliasTemplateDecl Ref
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
| `-TypeAliasDecl Ref 'const T &'
`-TypeAliasTemplateDecl Fn
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 ... Ts
  `-TypeAliasDecl Fn 'void (*)(Ts...)'
